  "description": "OPC UA for the AutomationML Editor. Imports OPC UA NodeSets as AML libraries according to OPC 10000-83 Annex A, creates and checks instances of UA types, and exports AML documents as NodeSets. Connects to OPC UA servers: imports their types, takes their nodes into the document and keeps values live; serves a document as an OPC UA server. Brings a practice plant (the MPS 500 learning factory, served on this computer), diagrams in OPC 10000-3 notation and the graphical modeler NodeSet.js. English and German.",
